Week 3 - Spring REST using Spring Boot
Spring Core Hands-ons (1 to 6)

Hands-ons Completed:
1. Created a Spring Boot Web Project using Spring Initializr, Maven, Spring Web and DevTools.
2. Configured and loaded a SimpleDateFormat bean from Spring XML and parsed dates using the Spring IoC Container.
